          "marked": false,
          "text": "**Revises an earlier Kody suggestion** on `src/billing/status.ts:8` (2026-09-30 00:46 UTC).\n\nRethrowing `NotReadyError` from `fetchStatus` now reaches `pollCharge`, which reads it as \"gateway never received it\" and calls `gw.submit(charge.payload)` again, so every poll tick on an already accepted but unsettled charge can create a duplicate charge. Make `pollCharge` treat `NotReadyError` as pending and retry the status poll without resubmitting (or add a distinct error type for the never-received case), and make `gw.submit` idempotent with a key based on `charge.id`."
